  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-agency management with user roles and granular permissions",
    "Complete reservation management for trips, seats, and tickets",
    "QR Code digital tickets with real-time encrypted verification",
    "Mobile Money, Visa/Mastercard, and cash payment processing with automatic invoicing",
    "QR check-in and crew attendance tracking with geolocation",
    "Baggage and parcel tracking from check-in to delivery",
    "Fleet management for buses, drivers, hostesses, and baggage handlers",
    "Real-time analytics dashboards and statistics",
    "Fully documented REST API (SaaS API) for third-party integrations",
    "Intelligent scheduling with calendar views and automatic staff planning",
    "Single perpetual license — no recurring subscriptions",
    "Multi-language interface (English, French, Spanish, Arabic, and more)"
